0..57 Comment "//! This record type holds the components of `Model(LC)`."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..136 Comment "//! The derivation fixes the order of fields. The fields include contexts,"
137..183 Comment "//! substitutions, terms, operations and laws."
184..187 Comment "//!"
188..266 Comment "//! Component indices use the order of their source sorts. So `liftTm` and law"
267..344 Comment "//! 2 take `d` before `g`, because their first binder is `s : Sub(d, g)`. The"
345..421 Comment "//! syntax model packs into this record as `SyntaxNat` packs into the record"
422..495 Comment "//! of `Nat`\'s models in `model-in-source.gandr`. Beta reduction uses one"
496..513 Comment "//! substitution."
514..517 Comment "//!"
518..533 Comment "//! - see: #640"
535..596 Comment "// This source imports naturals, syntax and the syntax model."
597..603 Keyword "import"
